{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3d4c767713194bf85ccd6ba580bb938f487049b9370281e260ab1e2493eb81fa",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:996c976f7182edb0687f083a510ef47f0a647e92af370acd2cd74ee1fb0a831c",
      "text": "为了迎接那一天的到来",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7fc5c5a3ecbb7d71a63ad437d552a26bb3cc42769b6c92ce31cfdca15070cc1",
      "text": "唔——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cf02304393d00f803b34caec7d0dee7ebef16056fcfab6e68d807153b93284a",
      "text": "怎么了吗，辉先生。一脸苦相……\n是有什么烦心事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:521d3a40b0ef8e135545b044490dd050e6e8b9377796eda671378134ac7509bf",
      "text": "别管他。\n反正不是什么大不了的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7f44b043381e82f6cfa0f53d7d92e7777d2b77a2161296be9044fa5d170a34",
      "text": "说什么呢，这可是头等大事！\n我正在为MC环节要讲的话发愁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e6a3b571835721ddc77f373cdba66994cdd68b7a7c384b2e2a8d30d0cb304f",
      "text": "能引爆全场的最棒段子，\n怎么想都想不出来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27bde419c17966b1d035ab07c124dcef3124ead6c9904a687902e1d258dfb5e5",
      "text": "……你看吧。我就知道是这种事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26a99a6c776e85b42564c9ca0e6d3ecd58bd2ebde4852c952345d7df4e15f429",
      "text": "要是想不出段子的话，围绕着挑衅或者\n挑战之类的，想不出什么点子吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b9f284b31217bbec9b011bfdca35f9ad6519cad8bb1b4bc438ecb0112dfc69d",
      "text": "柏木，别顺着他。差不多该重新开始练习了。\n联合排练迫在眉睫了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ddd677cc4cbda8ef4625bc2682bb42203057c07a4937b027b9b143379f3b948",
      "text": "说的也是呢。MC的事情等练习之后\n大家再一起想吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04727c9d392753072b1f50286e12b05eeb96001d16505f0f194040be58527699",
      "text": "啊啊，也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_009_22_5_06_009_22:5_06_009_22:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39f73bdc0a14ece4f80d0d0427d3b0dfed01008f61a6b90730b54fbb936d6daf",
      "text": "联合排练的日子也很近了。\n现在总之先专心练习吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
